{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "49a48917-1723-8efb-9844-a923f0f35e39",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T10:48:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:45:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:45:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. This is Siobhan Reardon. I think I'm calling about a storm drain, maybe, or sort of a flooding thing, on Kay Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:45:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, go ahead. Whereabouts on Kay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:46:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 216 Kay Street, up in Historic Hill. I'm the landlord there, I think the drain out front is sort of blocked, or maybe it just can't keep up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:46:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, 216 Kay. What's it doing right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:46:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the water is, I think, over the curb and across the sidewalk. It's still there from last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, and I'd say it's maybe up to the hubcaps on a car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:46:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps. Wow. So that's still sitting there two days later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:46:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I think so. It sort of goes down a little and then comes back. And a delivery truck got stuck in it this morning, I think around nine or so. The driver had to wait for somebody to help him back out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:46:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me get this down. Water over the curb, across the sidewalk, hubcap deep, delivery truck stuck this morning. Anybody hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, nobody was hurt, I don't think. The truck's gone now. But I do check on an elderly neighbor every evening, she's a few doors down, and I think she'd have trouble getting through that to her steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's worth flagging. I'll note it so the crew knows people are walking there. Is the water getting into any buildings, as far as you can see?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I can tell, maybe not. It's sort of stopped at the bottom step of my building. I'd say it's just the street and the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Alright, I'll send this over to the drainage crew as a storm drain backup at 216 Kay Street. They're pretty busy after a storm like that, so I can't tell you exactly when they'll get there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I understand. Could somebody maybe call me back when it's done? I think that would help, so I know it's cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. What's a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0166. That's a landline, I think it rings through to the kitchen, so it should be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0166, Siobhan Reardon. I'll put a note to call you once the work is finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:48:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:48:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Take care, and stay out of that puddle."
    }
  ],
